1. The WBGT model
-----------------

src/lib/physics/liljegren.ts and src/lib/physics/solar.ts are a TypeScript
port of WBGT version 1.1 by James C. Liljegren, Argonne National Laboratory,
including the solarposition() routine that ships with it. The port was made
by Raffa Gamadan Rifandi in 2026. What was changed is noted at the top of
each file: double precision throughout, a fallback solver where the original
iteration does not settle, and a corrected day count in the sun position for
leap years after 2000.

