2. Data
-------

Forecasts, ensemble forecasts, reanalysis and place search are fetched by
the browser from Open-Meteo (https://open-meteo.com), whose data is licensed
under CC BY 4.0.

The heat record is computed from ERA5 and ERA5-Land. Contains modified
Copernicus Climate Change Service information, 1961 to the present. Neither
the European Commission nor ECMWF is responsible for any use that may be
made of the Copernicus information or data it contains.

Place names come from GeoNames (https://www.geonames.org) under CC BY 4.0,
through Open-Meteo's geocoding API. When "Use my location" is tapped, the
place name is looked up with BigDataCloud (https://www.bigdatacloud.com).


